{"suttaId":"tha-ap445","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[865,885],"vripara":"15"},"segments":{"tha-ap445:0.3":"Billiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap445:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, assamo sukato mama;","tha-ap445:1.3":"Billarukkhehi [beluvarukkhehi (syā.)] ākiṇṇo, nānādumanisevito.","tha-ap445:2.1":"“Sugandhaṃ beluvaṃ disvā, buddhaseṭṭhamanussariṃ;","tha-ap445:2.3":"Khāribhāraṃ pūrayitvā, tuṭṭho saṃviggamānaso.","tha-ap445:3.1":"“Kakusandhaṃ upāgamma, billapakkamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap445:3.3":"Puññakkhettassa vīrassa, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap445:4.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappasmiṃ, yaṃ phalamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap445:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap445:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap445:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap445:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap445:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā billiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap445:9.1":"Billiyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
